{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33034","headline":"文宗陵 · 曹邺","name":"文宗陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千年尧舜心，心成身已殁。\n始随苍梧云，不返苍龙阙。\n宫女衣不香，黄金赐白发。\n留此奉天下，所以无征伐。\n至今汨罗水，不葬大夫骨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33034.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33034","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}